## `spec` fields

A skills marketplace the tenant imports skills from (a git repository, a registry, or any
``shoal.skill_sources`` plugin). Tenant-wide; its secrets are read from the ``shared`` namespace.

These are the top-level fields of the SkillSource spec, the same as `spec:` in YAML. Nested objects are described in the
server's JSON Schema at `GET /v1/schemas` (also used by the UI builder for validation).

| Field | Type | | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `source` | string | **required** | Skill source plugin: git, registry, or any installed plugin. |
| `title` | string | optional |  |
| `description` | string | optional |  |
| `config` | map | optional | Non-secret settings (see the plugin's schema). |
| `secrets` | map | optional | Config field -> secret name in `shared`. |
| `namespaces` | list of string | optional | Namespaces that may browse and import (empty: all). |
| `enabled` | bool | optional |  Default: `true`. |

